1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,520
Chhota-mota kaam bhi nahi mil raha. Kya kismat hai!

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:08,479
Munna, har ghar mein kapde press hote hain, roz! Press ki dukaan khol!

3
00:00:08,779 --> 00:00:11,419
Press wala? Usme kya kamai hogi, Chacha?

4
00:00:11,719 --> 00:00:16,980
Bhaari press, ek table, aur society ke bahar ek kona. Bas 10 hazaar.

5
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:23,099
WhatsApp pe order le, ghar se kapde utha, ghar pe pahuncha. Yahi teri service hai.

6
00:00:23,649 --> 00:00:26,956
Munna, ye 20 kapde shaam tak chahiye. Sahab ki meeting hai!

7
00:00:27,256 --> 00:00:30,027
Shaam tak pakka, aunty ji. 15 rupaye kapda.

8
00:00:30,327 --> 00:00:34,245
Roz 150-200 kapde, yaani 2 se 3 hazaar roz.

9
00:00:34,545 --> 00:00:39,459
Steam press le le, aur dry cleaner se tie-up kar. Har kapde pe commission.

10
00:00:39,759 --> 00:00:43,562
Munna Press Wala, poori society ka favourite! Life set!
